  "description": "JEWEL FOR THRIATHLETES…A WINNING ALLY! BOLIDE TR is Pinarello's answer to the evolution of the Triathlon world. Brought by Cameron Wurf to debut in the fantastic scenery of Kona, in Hawaii it immediately set the record in the road segment that it already held since the last edition. BOLIDE TR is made of TorayCa T700 UD carbon which, thanks to its extraordinary stiffness and comfort characteristics, makes it perfect for all triathletes engaged in the toughest no-draft competitions. The PinaLab technicians worked on driveability and comfort, also designing object holders perfectly integrated on the frame tested in the wind tunnel.",
